{"mode":"words","text":"Üleval näed teksti täpselt nii, nagu rakendus seda sulle kuvab. Iga sõna on väike kaart: ülaosas on sõna sihtkeeles, selle all selle tähendus emakeeles – sõna-sõnalt, sihtkeele järjekorras. Allpool on kogu lause veel kord sujuvalt tõlgitud. Keelte puhul, millel on teistsugune kirjasüsteem, lisatakse rida transkriptsiooniga, et saaksid kõike lugeda. Puuduta sõna: hääl jätkab just sealt edasi.","words":[{"s":0,"e":320},{"s":373,"e":560},{"s":600,"e":880},{"s":933,"e":1360},{"s":1400,"e":1840},{"s":1860,"e":2000},{"s":2060,"e":2480},{"s":2540,"e":2800},{"s":2820,"e":3040},{"s":3080,"e":3600},{"s":4000,"e":4560},{"s":4640,"e":4880},{"s":4907,"e":4960},{"s":5013,"e":5280},{"s":5360,"e":6240},{"s":6440,"e":7120},{"s":7173,"e":7280},{"s":7320,"e":7520},{"s":7573,"e":8800},{"s":8880,"e":9120},{"s":9180,"e":9360},{"s":9480,"e":9680},{"s":9720,"e":10160},{"s":10213,"e":10960},{"s":11240,"e":11520},{"s":11560,"e":12400},{"s":12453,"e":13040},{"s":13080,"e":13920},{"s":14180,"e":15200},{"s":15307,"e":15520},{"s":15560,"e":15760},{"s":15813,"e":16240},{"s":16336,"e":16720},{"s":16800,"e":17040},{"s":17093,"e":17520},{"s":17560,"e":18240},{"s":18613,"e":19600},{"s":19640,"e":20080},{"s":20160,"e":20400},{"s":20427,"e":20480},{"s":20533,"e":21120},{"s":21160,"e":22080},{"s":22200,"e":22960},{"s":23000,"e":23280},{"s":23347,"e":24720},{"s":24773,"e":24880},{"s":24907,"e":25280},{"s":25320,"e":25600},{"s":25640,"e":26160},{"s":26587,"e":27760},{"s":27800,"e":28600},{"s":28773,"e":29280},{"s":29333,"e":29760},{"s":29808,"e":30000},{"s":30053,"e":30400},{"s":30427,"e":30880}]}